				<r3d:description language="eng">The publication platform perspectivia.net sees itself as an international, epoch-spanning and interdisciplinary portal for digital publications in the humanities and social sciences. Scientific publications of the Max Weber Foundation (MWS, Max Weber Stiftung) and its partners can be published free of charge on the Open Access publication platform perspectivia.net in the sense of Diamond Open Access. Also, research data can be published either directly in perspectivia.net or in another suitable repository and will be indexed in perspectivia.net via a persistent identifier. For sensitive and copyright-protected research data that is not suitable for publication, the metadata is published on perspectivia.net. DOI assignment and bibliographic references are provided regardless of this.
The services are primarily aimed at researchers within the worldwide MWS network, whether at the institutes or at the numerous partner institutions. In addition, the scientific advisory board of perspectivia.net decides on the inclusion of data according to content and organisational criteria.</r3d:description>
